expected: {"metrics":[{"name":"valid_order","aliases":["有效订单","有效订单数","有效订单量","剔除取消","排除取消"],"description":"有效订单——排除已取消和不可用的订单","expression":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","tables":["orders"],"notes":"【最重要的一条口径】电商里「取消/不可用」的订单不代表成交，\n计入任何业务指标都会虚高。实测 25 条业务口径题里有 17 条要求这个过滤，\n是最高频的口径。**只要题目没明说包含全部订单，默认就要排除。**\n"},{"name":"gmv_with_freight","aliases":["GMV","成交总额","商品交易总额","含运费"],"description":"GMV（含运费）= 商品金额 + 运费","expression":"SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value)","tables":["order_items","orders"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"GMV 含不含运费是行业里长期有争议的口径。本项目采用**含运费**，\n理由：运费是客户实际支付的金额，属于成交额。\n"},{"name":"unique_buyers","aliases":["下单人数","购买人数","下单买家数","独立买家数"],"description":"下单人数 = 去重独立下单用户数（customer_unique_id）","expression":"COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id)","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"【关键】统计「下单人数/买家数」时，必须关联 customers 表并按 c.customer_unique_id 去重，\n严禁使用 orders.customer_id（customer_id 是订单级令牌，每笔订单都不一样，去重结果等于订单数）。\n"},{"name":"sales_without_freight","aliases":["不含运费销售额","净销售额"],"description":"销售额（不含运费）= 商品金额合计","expression":"SUM(oi.price)","tables":["order_items","orders"],"notes":"只统计商品本身的金额。若用户明确询问「不含运费」或「商品净销售额」时使用。\n与 gmv_with_freight（含运费）互为补充。\n"},{"name":"aov","aliases":["客单价","平均订单金额","订单均价"],"description":"客单价 = GMV / 有效订单数","expression":"ROUND(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2)","tables":["orders","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母是**订单数**不是人数。若题目问「人均消费」才是除以人数。\n分子用含运费 GMV，与 gmv_with_freight 保持一致。\n","outputRule":"只输出题目要求的客单价列；不要额外输出 GMV、订单数或其他中间量。"},{"name":"repeat_rate","aliases":["复购率","回购率","重复购买率"],"description":"复购率 = 下单 2 次及以上的用户 / 全部下单用户","expression":"COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE order_cnt >= 2) * 100.0 / COUNT(*)\n","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"【关键】统计单位是**人**（customer_unique_id）不是订单。\n订单级 customer_id 每人只有一次，用它算复购率恒为 0。\n先按人聚合出订单数，再判断 >= 2。\n"},{"name":"on_time_rate","aliases":["准时率","准时送达率","按时送达率"],"description":"准时率 = 实际送达不晚于预计送达的订单 / 已送达订单","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (\n  WHERE o.order_delivered_customer_date <= o.order_estimated_delivery_date\n) / COUNT(*), 2)\n","tables":["orders"],"notes":"分母是**已送达订单**（order_delivered_customer_date IS NOT NULL），\n不是全部订单。未送达的订单无法判断是否准时，计入分母会拉低准时率。\n"},{"name":"refund_rate","aliases":["退款率","退货率"],"description":"退款率 = 退款订单数 / 有效订单数","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT r.order_id) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2)","tables":["refunds","orders"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母用有效订单，与 valid_order 口径一致。"},{"name":"sell_through_rate","aliases":["动销率","动销商品率","售罄率"],"description":"动销率 = 有销量的商品数 / 全部商品数","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT oi.product_id) / (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM products), 2)","tables":["order_items","orders","products"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母是**全部商品数**（products 表全量），不是「有库存的商品」。\n这是【需确认】口径：电商里两种算法都有人用，本项目选全部商品。\n分子只算有效订单里的商品，否则取消单的商品会被算成动销。\n","outputRule":"输出百分比，乘 100 并保留 2 位小数；只输出动销率列。","queryPattern":"WITH sold AS (\n  SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT oi.product_id) AS n\n  FROM order_items oi\n  JOIN orders o ON o.order_id = oi.order_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n), allp AS (\n  SELECT COUNT(*) AS n FROM products\n)\nSELECT ROUND(100.0 * sold.n / NULLIF(allp.n, 0), 2) AS sell_through_pct\nFROM sold CROSS JOIN allp;\n"},{"name":"member_penetration","aliases":["会员渗透率","会员订单占比","会员占比"],"description":"会员渗透率 = 会员贡献的有效订单 / 全部有效订单","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) FILTER (WHERE m.member_id IS NOT NULL) / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 0), 2)","tables":["orders","customers","members"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"按**订单**算渗透率，不是按人数。members 与 customers 靠\ncustomer_unique_id 关联（人级），不是 customer_id（订单级）。\n从 orders 出发，LEFT JOIN customers 后 LEFT JOIN members，保留非会员订单作为分母。\n不得用 INNER JOIN members 或在 WHERE 中要求会员非空，否则会丢失非会员分母。\n分子、分母均按 order_id 去重，防止同一人多条会员记录放大订单数。\n使用当前会员表判断会员身份；不推断下单时历史会员身份。\n","outputRule":"输出 0–100 的百分数，保留两位小数；无有效订单时返回 NULL（未定义），不强行记为 0。","queryPattern":"SELECT ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) FILTER (WHERE m.member_id IS NOT NULL)\n  / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 0), 2) AS member_order_pct\nFROM orders o\nLEFT JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\nLEFT JOIN members m ON m.customer_unique_id = c.customer_unique_id\nWHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable');\n"},{"name":"low_score_rate","aliases":["低分率","差评率","低分占比","低分订单","低分评价","差评占比"],"description":"低分率 = 评分 <= 2 的评价 / 全部评价","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE r.review_score <= 2) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["order_reviews"],"notes":"低分定义为 1–2 星（含）。5 分制下 3 分通常算中评。\n\n【两种场景，看题目限定范围】\n· 全站/按州统计低分率（如 T6-009）→ 要排除取消/不可用订单。\n· 「退款订单的低分率」这类题（如 T6-024）已经把范围限定在退款集合内，\n  **不要再叠加订单状态过滤**——那会把口径改错。\n所以这一条**不设默认 filter**，由题目限定范围决定。\n"},{"name":"ctr","aliases":["搜索转化率","点击率","搜索点击率"],"description":"搜索转化率 = 有点击的搜索记录 / 全部搜索记录","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE clicked_product_id IS NOT NULL) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["search_logs"],"notes":"分母是搜索记录数，不是用户数。"},{"name":"freight_ratio","aliases":["运费占比","运费比例","运费占GMV"],"description":"运费占比 = 运费 / GMV","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * SUM(oi.freight_value) / SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 2)","tables":["order_items","orders"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母是含运费 GMV，保证口径自洽（分子是分母的一部分）。","outputRule":"输出百分比，乘 100 并保留 2 位小数；只输出 macro_region 和 freight_pct。","queryPattern":"SELECT r.macro_region,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(oi.freight_value) /\n             NULLIF(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 0), 2) AS freight_pct\nFROM orders o\nJOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\nJOIN regions r ON r.region_code = c.customer_state\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\nWHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY freight_pct DESC;\n"},{"name":"mau","aliases":["MAU","月活","活跃用户数","活跃下单用户"],"description":"月活跃用户 = 当月有有效订单的去重人数","expression":"COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id)","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"【两种场景，看题目限定范围】全站低分率（如按州统计）要排除取消/不可用订单；\n而「退款订单的低分率」这类题目已把范围限定在退款集合内，**不要再叠加订单状态过滤**。\n\n本项目用**下单行为**定义活跃，不用登录行为（库里没有登录表）。\n去重单位是 customer_unique_id（人级），不是 customer_id。\n"},{"name":"sla_rate","aliases":["SLA达成率","SLA 达成率","SLA达标率","SLA 达标率","工单达成率","SLA"],"description":"SLA 达成率 = 解决时长不超过类目 SLA 的工单 / 全部工单","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (\n  WHERE st.resolved_at IS NOT NULL\n    AND EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (st.resolved_at - st.created_at)) / 3600.0 <= tc.sla_hours\n) / COUNT(*), 2)\n","tables":["support_tickets","ticket_categories"],"notes":"分母是**全部工单**（含未解决的）。未解决的工单算未达成。"},{"name":"discount_rate","aliases":["折扣率","优惠率","用券折扣"],"description":"折扣率 = 优惠金额 / GMV","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * SUM(cu.discount_amount) / SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 2)","tables":["coupon_usages","orders","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"只统计用券订单，分子分母都在同一个订单集合内。","outputRule":"依次输出 GMV、优惠金额、折扣率三列；金额保留 2 位小数，折扣率乘 100 保留 2 位小数；不要输出额外中间量。","queryPattern":"SELECT ROUND(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 2) AS gmv,\n       ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount), 2) AS discount,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(cu.discount_amount) /\n             NULLIF(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 0), 2) AS discount_pct\nFROM coupon_usages cu\nJOIN orders o ON o.order_id = cu.order_id\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = cu.order_id\nWHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable');\n"},{"name":"commission_rate","aliases":["佣金率","平台抽成","佣金比例"],"description":"佣金率 = 佣金 / 结算毛额","expression":"SUM(si.commission_amount) / SUM(si.gross_amount)","tables":["settlements","settlement_items"],"notes":"平台整体佣金率 = 总佣金 / 总结算额（不是各卖家佣金率的平均值，\n那样大卖家和小卖家权重相同，会失真）。要卖家级分布时单独按卖家聚合。\n"},{"name":"conversion_rate","aliases":["转化率","推荐转化率","活动转化率"],"description":"转化率 = 已转化的推荐 / 全部推荐","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE converted_at IS NOT NULL) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["referrals"],"notes":"分母是全部推荐记录。"},{"name":"reward_per_converted","aliases":["人均奖励","平均奖励","人均返利"],"description":"人均奖励 = 奖励总额 / 已转化的推荐数","expression":"ROUND(SUM(reward_amount) / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE converted_at IS NOT NULL), 0), 2)","tables":["referrals"],"notes":"【易错点】分母是**已转化**的推荐数，不是全部推荐数。\n写成 SUM(reward_amount) / COUNT(*) 会算成「每条推荐的平均奖励」，\n比「每次成功推荐拿到多少」小得多。实测 T6-017 就是这样算错的：\ngold 是 20.01，模型给 6.78。\n"},{"name":"retention_rate","aliases":["留存率","次月留存","用户留存"],"description":"留存率 = 首单后再次下单的用户 / 同期首单用户","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(returned) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"先按人取首单时间确定同期群（cohort），再看该群在目标窗口内\n是否还有有效订单。统计单位是人，不是订单。\n","outputRule":"只输出 cohort_month 和 retention_pct 两列；不要展开成 cohort_month × activity_month 明细，也不要输出 cohort_users 或 retained_users 中间量。","queryPattern":"WITH first_order AS (\n  SELECT c.customer_unique_id, MIN(o.order_purchase_timestamp) AS first_ts\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n  GROUP BY 1\n), cohort AS (\n  SELECT customer_unique_id, DATE_TRUNC('month', first_ts)::date AS cohort_month\n  FROM first_order\n  WHERE first_ts >= DATE '2017-01-01' AND first_ts < DATE '2017-07-01'\n), returner AS (\n  SELECT DISTINCT co.customer_unique_id, co.cohort_month\n  FROM cohort co\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_unique_id = co.customer_unique_id\n  JOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= DATE '2017-07-01'\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < DATE '2018-01-01'\n)\nSELECT co.cohort_month,\n       ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(re.customer_unique_id) / COUNT(*), 2) AS retention_pct\nFROM cohort co\nLEFT JOIN returner re ON re.customer_unique_id = co.customer_unique_id\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1;\n"},{"name":"gmv_per_user","aliases":["人均GMV","人均消费","人均成交额"],"description":"人均 GMV = 用户总 GMV / 用户数","expression":"ROUND(AVG(gmv), 2)","tables":["orders","customers","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"先按人聚合出每人 GMV，再取平均——不是「总 GMV / 人数」。\n两者在有用户下多单时结果不同：先聚合再平均才是「人均」的准确含义。\n"},{"name":"inventory_turnover_days","aliases":["库存周转天数","周转天数","库存周转"],"description":"库存周转天数 = 90 天 * 当前库存 / 近 90 天出库量","expression":"ROUND(90.0 * SUM(i.quantity) / NULLIF(SUM(im.quantity), 0), 1)","tables":["inventory","inventory_movements","warehouses"],"notes":"出库用 movement_type = 2。分母为 0 时返回 NULL 而不是除零错误。\n时间窗口以**数据里的最大时间**为锚点，不是 CURRENT_DATE——\n公开数据集是历史快照，用当前日期会算出负数天数。\n"},{"name":"delivery_days","aliases":["配送时长","配送天数","送达时长","平均配送","物流时长"],"description":"平均配送时长 = 下单到签收的天数（保留小数）","expression":"ROUND((AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (o.order_delivered_customer_date - o.order_purchase_timestamp)) / 86400.0))::numeric, 2)","tables":["orders"],"notes":"【两个易错点】\n1. 用 EPOCH 换算成小数天，**不要用 EXTRACT(DAY ...)**——后者只取整数部分，\n   跨月的时长会被截断（比如 40 天会算成 9 天）。\n2. 只统计已送达订单（order_delivered_customer_date IS NOT NULL），\n   未送达的订单没有签收时间，参与计算会得到 NULL 或错误值。\n"},{"name":"yoy_growth","aliases":["同比增长","同比增长率","YoY"],"description":"同比增长率 = (本期 - 同期) / 同期","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * (m18.gmv - m17.gmv) / m17.gmv, 2)","tables":["orders","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"按月对齐两个年度，缺月份的年份自然不参与（INNER JOIN）。","outputRule":"依次输出月份、2017 GMV、2018 GMV、同比增长率；GMV 保留 2 位小数，同比增长率乘 100 保留 2 位小数；不要输出年度中间行。","queryPattern":"WITH monthly AS (\n  SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM o.order_purchase_timestamp)::int AS yr,\n         EXTRACT(MONTH FROM o.order_purchase_timestamp)::int AS mo,\n         SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) AS gmv\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n  GROUP BY 1, 2\n)\nSELECT m18.mo,\n       ROUND(m17.gmv, 2) AS gmv_2017,\n       ROUND(m18.gmv, 2) AS gmv_2018,\n       ROUND(100.0 * (m18.gmv - m17.gmv) / NULLIF(m17.gmv, 0), 2) AS yoy_pct\nFROM monthly m18\nJOIN monthly m17 ON m17.mo = m18.mo AND m17.yr = 2017\nWHERE m18.yr = 2018\nORDER BY m18.mo;\n"}],"dimensionPolicies":[{"name":"product_category_nulls_v1","table":"products","column":"product_category_name","aliases":["商品类目","商品分类","商品品类","类目","品类"],"defaultFilter":"products.product_category_name IS NOT NULL","notes":"该口径只处理SQL NULL，不自动排除空字符串、未翻译的类目或文字值“未知”。 多个商品可属于同一订单：统计每类目的订单数时按订单去重，一个订单跨多个类目可分别计入各组， 不能把各类目的订单数相加当成全站去重订单数。显示英文类目时，翻译缺失与原始类目NULL是两件事， 用户要求保留未知时不能用内连接翻译表把这类记录提前丢掉。"}]}
 but was: {"metrics":[{"name":"valid_order","aliases":["有效订单","有效订单数","有效订单量","剔除取消","排除取消"],"description":"有效订单——排除已取消和不可用的订单","expression":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","tables":["orders"],"notes":"【最重要的一条口径】电商里「取消/不可用」的订单不代表成交，\n计入任何业务指标都会虚高。实测 25 条业务口径题里有 17 条要求这个过滤，\n是最高频的口径。**只要题目没明说包含全部订单，默认就要排除。**\n"},{"name":"gmv_with_freight","aliases":["GMV","成交总额","商品交易总额","含运费"],"description":"GMV（含运费）= 商品金额 + 运费","expression":"SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value)","tables":["order_items","orders"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"GMV 含不含运费是行业里长期有争议的口径。本项目采用**含运费**，\n理由：运费是客户实际支付的金额，属于成交额。\n"},{"name":"unique_buyers","aliases":["下单人数","购买人数","下单买家数","独立买家数"],"description":"下单人数 = 去重独立下单用户数（customer_unique_id）","expression":"COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id)","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"【关键】统计「下单人数/买家数」时，必须关联 customers 表并按 c.customer_unique_id 去重，\n严禁使用 orders.customer_id（customer_id 是订单级令牌，每笔订单都不一样，去重结果等于订单数）。\n"},{"name":"sales_without_freight","aliases":["不含运费销售额","净销售额"],"description":"销售额（不含运费）= 商品金额合计","expression":"SUM(oi.price)","tables":["order_items","orders"],"notes":"只统计商品本身的金额。若用户明确询问「不含运费」或「商品净销售额」时使用。\n与 gmv_with_freight（含运费）互为补充。\n"},{"name":"aov","aliases":["客单价","平均订单金额","订单均价"],"description":"客单价 = GMV / 有效订单数","expression":"ROUND(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2)","tables":["orders","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母是**订单数**不是人数。若题目问「人均消费」才是除以人数。\n分子用含运费 GMV，与 gmv_with_freight 保持一致。\n","outputRule":"只输出题目要求的客单价列；不要额外输出 GMV、订单数或其他中间量。"},{"name":"repeat_rate","aliases":["复购率","回购率","重复购买率"],"description":"复购率 = 下单 2 次及以上的用户 / 全部下单用户","expression":"COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE order_cnt >= 2) * 100.0 / COUNT(*)\n","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"【关键】统计单位是**人**（customer_unique_id）不是订单。\n订单级 customer_id 每人只有一次，用它算复购率恒为 0。\n先按人聚合出订单数，再判断 >= 2。\n"},{"name":"on_time_rate","aliases":["准时率","准时送达率","按时送达率"],"description":"准时率 = 实际送达不晚于预计送达的订单 / 已送达订单","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (\n  WHERE o.order_delivered_customer_date <= o.order_estimated_delivery_date\n) / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (\n  WHERE o.order_delivered_customer_date IS NOT NULL\n), 0), 2)\n","tables":["orders"],"notes":"分母是**已送达订单**（order_delivered_customer_date IS NOT NULL），\n不是全部订单。未送达的订单无法判断是否准时，计入分母会拉低准时率。\n分子与分母过滤均已写入表达式，不以order_status='delivered'替代签收时间非空。\n预计送达时间缺失的已签收订单仍在分母，不能确认准时则不进入分子；分母为0返回NULL。\n与商品等一对多明细共同统计时，先保留一行一订单，不能让明细数量给订单加权。\n"},{"name":"refund_rate","aliases":["退款率","退货率"],"description":"退款率 = 退款订单数 / 有效订单数","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT r.order_id) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2)","tables":["refunds","orders"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母用有效订单，与 valid_order 口径一致。"},{"name":"sell_through_rate","aliases":["动销率","动销商品率","售罄率"],"description":"动销率 = 有销量的商品数 / 全部商品数","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT oi.product_id) / (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM products), 2)","tables":["order_items","orders","products"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母是**全部商品数**（products 表全量），不是「有库存的商品」。\n这是【需确认】口径：电商里两种算法都有人用，本项目选全部商品。\n分子只算有效订单里的商品，否则取消单的商品会被算成动销。\n","outputRule":"输出百分比，乘 100 并保留 2 位小数；只输出动销率列。","queryPattern":"WITH sold AS (\n  SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT oi.product_id) AS n\n  FROM order_items oi\n  JOIN orders o ON o.order_id = oi.order_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n), allp AS (\n  SELECT COUNT(*) AS n FROM products\n)\nSELECT ROUND(100.0 * sold.n / NULLIF(allp.n, 0), 2) AS sell_through_pct\nFROM sold CROSS JOIN allp;\n"},{"name":"member_penetration","aliases":["会员渗透率","会员订单占比","会员占比"],"description":"会员渗透率 = 会员贡献的有效订单 / 全部有效订单","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) FILTER (WHERE m.member_id IS NOT NULL) / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 0), 2)","tables":["orders","customers","members"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"按**订单**算渗透率，不是按人数。members 与 customers 靠\ncustomer_unique_id 关联（人级），不是 customer_id（订单级）。\n从 orders 出发，LEFT JOIN customers 后 LEFT JOIN members，保留非会员订单作为分母。\n不得用 INNER JOIN members 或在 WHERE 中要求会员非空，否则会丢失非会员分母。\n分子、分母均按 order_id 去重，防止同一人多条会员记录放大订单数。\n使用当前会员表判断会员身份；不推断下单时历史会员身份。\n","outputRule":"输出 0–100 的百分数，保留两位小数；无有效订单时返回 NULL（未定义），不强行记为 0。","queryPattern":"SELECT ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) FILTER (WHERE m.member_id IS NOT NULL)\n  / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 0), 2) AS member_order_pct\nFROM orders o\nLEFT JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\nLEFT JOIN members m ON m.customer_unique_id = c.customer_unique_id\nWHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable');\n"},{"name":"low_score_rate","aliases":["低分率","差评率","低分占比","低分订单","低分评价","差评占比"],"description":"低分率 = 评分 <= 2 的评价 / 全部评价","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE r.review_score <= 2) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["order_reviews"],"notes":"低分定义为 1–2 星（含）。5 分制下 3 分通常算中评。\n\n【两种场景，看题目限定范围】\n· 全站/按州统计低分率（如 T6-009）→ 要排除取消/不可用订单。\n· 「退款订单的低分率」这类题（如 T6-024）已经把范围限定在退款集合内，\n  **不要再叠加订单状态过滤**——那会把口径改错。\n所以这一条**不设默认 filter**，由题目限定范围决定。\n"},{"name":"ctr","aliases":["搜索转化率","点击率","搜索点击率"],"description":"搜索转化率 = 有点击的搜索记录 / 全部搜索记录","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE clicked_product_id IS NOT NULL) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["search_logs"],"notes":"分母是搜索记录数，不是用户数。"},{"name":"freight_ratio","aliases":["运费占比","运费比例","运费占GMV"],"description":"运费占比 = 运费 / GMV","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * SUM(oi.freight_value) / SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 2)","tables":["order_items","orders"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"分母是含运费 GMV，保证口径自洽（分子是分母的一部分）。","outputRule":"输出百分比，乘 100 并保留 2 位小数；只输出 macro_region 和 freight_pct。","queryPattern":"SELECT r.macro_region,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(oi.freight_value) /\n             NULLIF(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 0), 2) AS freight_pct\nFROM orders o\nJOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\nJOIN regions r ON r.region_code = c.customer_state\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\nWHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY freight_pct DESC;\n"},{"name":"mau","aliases":["MAU","月活","活跃用户数","活跃下单用户"],"description":"月活跃用户 = 当月有有效订单的去重人数","expression":"COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id)","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"【两种场景，看题目限定范围】全站低分率（如按州统计）要排除取消/不可用订单；\n而「退款订单的低分率」这类题目已把范围限定在退款集合内，**不要再叠加订单状态过滤**。\n\n本项目用**下单行为**定义活跃，不用登录行为（库里没有登录表）。\n去重单位是 customer_unique_id（人级），不是 customer_id。\n"},{"name":"sla_rate","aliases":["SLA达成率","SLA 达成率","SLA达标率","SLA 达标率","工单达成率","SLA"],"description":"SLA 达成率 = 解决时长不超过类目 SLA 的工单 / 全部工单","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (\n  WHERE st.resolved_at IS NOT NULL\n    AND EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (st.resolved_at - st.created_at)) / 3600.0 <= tc.sla_hours\n) / COUNT(*), 2)\n","tables":["support_tickets","ticket_categories"],"notes":"分母是**全部工单**（含未解决的）。未解决的工单算未达成。"},{"name":"discount_rate","aliases":["折扣率","优惠率","用券折扣"],"description":"折扣率 = 优惠金额 / GMV","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * SUM(cu.discount_amount) / SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 2)","tables":["coupon_usages","orders","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"只统计用券订单，分子分母都在同一个订单集合内。","outputRule":"依次输出 GMV、优惠金额、折扣率三列；金额保留 2 位小数，折扣率乘 100 保留 2 位小数；不要输出额外中间量。","queryPattern":"SELECT ROUND(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 2) AS gmv,\n       ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount), 2) AS discount,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(cu.discount_amount) /\n             NULLIF(SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value), 0), 2) AS discount_pct\nFROM coupon_usages cu\nJOIN orders o ON o.order_id = cu.order_id\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = cu.order_id\nWHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable');\n"},{"name":"commission_rate","aliases":["佣金率","平台抽成","佣金比例"],"description":"佣金率 = 佣金 / 结算毛额","expression":"SUM(si.commission_amount) / SUM(si.gross_amount)","tables":["settlements","settlement_items"],"notes":"平台整体佣金率 = 总佣金 / 总结算额（不是各卖家佣金率的平均值，\n那样大卖家和小卖家权重相同，会失真）。要卖家级分布时单独按卖家聚合。\n"},{"name":"conversion_rate","aliases":["转化率","推荐转化率","活动转化率"],"description":"转化率 = 已转化的推荐 / 全部推荐","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE converted_at IS NOT NULL) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["referrals"],"notes":"分母是全部推荐记录。"},{"name":"reward_per_converted","aliases":["人均奖励","平均奖励","人均返利"],"description":"人均奖励 = 奖励总额 / 已转化的推荐数","expression":"ROUND(SUM(reward_amount) / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE converted_at IS NOT NULL), 0), 2)","tables":["referrals"],"notes":"【易错点】分母是**已转化**的推荐数，不是全部推荐数。\n写成 SUM(reward_amount) / COUNT(*) 会算成「每条推荐的平均奖励」，\n比「每次成功推荐拿到多少」小得多。实测 T6-017 就是这样算错的：\ngold 是 20.01，模型给 6.78。\n"},{"name":"retention_rate","aliases":["留存率","次月留存","用户留存"],"description":"留存率 = 首单后再次下单的用户 / 同期首单用户","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(returned) / COUNT(*), 2)","tables":["orders","customers"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"先按人取首单时间确定同期群（cohort），再看该群在目标窗口内\n是否还有有效订单。统计单位是人，不是订单。\n","outputRule":"只输出 cohort_month 和 retention_pct 两列；不要展开成 cohort_month × activity_month 明细，也不要输出 cohort_users 或 retained_users 中间量。","queryPattern":"WITH first_order AS (\n  SELECT c.customer_unique_id, MIN(o.order_purchase_timestamp) AS first_ts\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n  GROUP BY 1\n), cohort AS (\n  SELECT customer_unique_id, DATE_TRUNC('month', first_ts)::date AS cohort_month\n  FROM first_order\n  WHERE first_ts >= DATE '2017-01-01' AND first_ts < DATE '2017-07-01'\n), returner AS (\n  SELECT DISTINCT co.customer_unique_id, co.cohort_month\n  FROM cohort co\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_unique_id = co.customer_unique_id\n  JOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= DATE '2017-07-01'\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < DATE '2018-01-01'\n)\nSELECT co.cohort_month,\n       ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(re.customer_unique_id) / COUNT(*), 2) AS retention_pct\nFROM cohort co\nLEFT JOIN returner re ON re.customer_unique_id = co.customer_unique_id\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1;\n"},{"name":"gmv_per_user","aliases":["人均GMV","人均消费","人均成交额"],"description":"人均 GMV = 用户总 GMV / 用户数","expression":"ROUND(AVG(gmv), 2)","tables":["orders","customers","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"先按人聚合出每人 GMV，再取平均——不是「总 GMV / 人数」。\n两者在有用户下多单时结果不同：先聚合再平均才是「人均」的准确含义。\n"},{"name":"inventory_turnover_days","aliases":["库存周转天数","周转天数","库存周转"],"description":"库存周转天数 = 90 天 * 当前库存 / 近 90 天出库量","expression":"ROUND(90.0 * SUM(i.quantity) / NULLIF(SUM(im.quantity), 0), 1)","tables":["inventory","inventory_movements","warehouses"],"notes":"出库用 movement_type = 2。分母为 0 时返回 NULL 而不是除零错误。\n时间窗口以**数据里的最大时间**为锚点，不是 CURRENT_DATE——\n公开数据集是历史快照，用当前日期会算出负数天数。\n"},{"name":"delivery_days","aliases":["配送时长","配送天数","送达时长","平均配送","物流时长"],"description":"平均配送时长 = 下单到签收的天数（保留小数）","expression":"ROUND((AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (o.order_delivered_customer_date - o.order_purchase_timestamp)) / 86400.0))::numeric, 2)","tables":["orders"],"notes":"【两个易错点】\n1. 用 EPOCH 换算成小数天，**不要用 EXTRACT(DAY ...)**——后者只取整数部分，\n   跨月的时长会被截断（比如 40 天会算成 9 天）。\n2. 只统计已送达订单（order_delivered_customer_date IS NOT NULL），\n   未送达的订单没有签收时间，参与计算会得到 NULL 或错误值。\n"},{"name":"yoy_growth","aliases":["同比增长","同比增长率","YoY"],"description":"同比增长率 = (本期 - 同期) / 同期","expression":"ROUND(100.0 * (m18.gmv - m17.gmv) / m17.gmv, 2)","tables":["orders","order_items"],"filter":"o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')","notes":"按月对齐两个年度，缺月份的年份自然不参与（INNER JOIN）。","outputRule":"依次输出月份、2017 GMV、2018 GMV、同比增长率；GMV 保留 2 位小数，同比增长率乘 100 保留 2 位小数；不要输出年度中间行。","queryPattern":"WITH monthly AS (\n  SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM o.order_purchase_timestamp)::int AS yr,\n         EXTRACT(MONTH FROM o.order_purchase_timestamp)::int AS mo,\n         SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) AS gmv\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n  GROUP BY 1, 2\n)\nSELECT m18.mo,\n       ROUND(m17.gmv, 2) AS gmv_2017,\n       ROUND(m18.gmv, 2) AS gmv_2018,\n       ROUND(100.0 * (m18.gmv - m17.gmv) / NULLIF(m17.gmv, 0), 2) AS yoy_pct\nFROM monthly m18\nJOIN monthly m17 ON m17.mo = m18.mo AND m17.yr = 2017\nWHERE m18.yr = 2018\nORDER BY m18.mo;\n"}],"dimensionPolicies":[{"name":"product_category_nulls_v1","table":"products","column":"product_category_name","aliases":["商品类目","商品分类","商品品类","类目","品类"],"defaultFilter":"products.product_category_name IS NOT NULL","notes":"该口径只处理SQL NULL，不自动排除空字符串、未翻译的类目或文字值“未知”。 多个商品可属于同一订单：统计每类目的订单数时按订单去重，一个订单跨多个类目可分别计入各组， 不能把各类目的订单数相加当成全站去重订单数。显示英文类目时，翻译缺失与原始类目NULL是两件事， 用户要求保留未知时不能用内连接翻译表把这类记录提前丢掉。"}]}
